  "releaseNotes": "1.0.8 - Native multi-barcode rendering for QR Code, PDF417, Data Matrix, and Aztec; IATA BCBP payload builder; AnchorId-based HTML-owned barcode placement; boarding-pass samples for mobile, paper PDF417, swapped paper layout, multi-leg, and PDF/A-3 marker coverage; regression tests for barcode round trips, positioned anchors, layout-owned barcode slots, and route icon centering. Previous 1.0.x notes remain in git history.",
